			"Message": "style(Output): Standardize comment dashes and fix entity encoding\n\nReformat comment dashes in `RuntimeDiagnosticsInner` (source and compiled) from Unicode en-dashes to standard ASCII hyphens to ensure consistent build artifacts and compatibility with strict linting rules. Additionally, fix the `&nbsp;` entity in `README.md` to use the correct numeric entity `&#x2001;` for proper whitespace rendering.\n\nThese minor style corrections align the generated output and documentation with the project's strict formatting standards without altering functional logic.",
